7570 TILE SCROLL 0,0
7580 END PROC
7590 ' the stars drift down: the map moves a pixel per frame and gets a new row on top after 24 pixels; four palette entries twinkle
7600 PROC STARS
7610 SF=SF+1
7620 IF SF>=24 THEN
7630 SF=0
7640 SM$=FN STARROW$()+LEFT$(SM$,492)
7650 TILE FILL SM$
